{"title":"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the diagram, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/7/8979a90508c0ae23a7504d9061460ea4dc4a3e40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle PQR = 90^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"107\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/c/0cc47c7048f3d6b142136996e57092be1f76a39c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 30 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 60 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 90 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 10 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"433\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the diagram, we can see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/7/897a5983c1868d04e0e22b185bad9830e29081f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle PQS = 2x^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"123\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/8/1d8256d7b6ec21aba99deb3915e812e47c90a5d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle RQS = x^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"113\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/9/e69bcf798997273a01436bd55b6a8350b8f4c8a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle PQS + m\\angle RQS = m\\angle PQR = 90^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"309\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>This allows us to solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/f/d1f927d4eb3dbd5fec816c4f3e03dbb9435753fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x + x = 90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"96\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/7/1d711dc3e4b767cb31c2c0d5419968ed197da85b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x = 90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/7/b8719fd007ad51858ae620a0cf0a963d2d4bf9a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 30}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"102\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (